    "format": "single-image",
    "targetAudience": "B2B Revenue Leaders & Commercial Executives",
    "contentBrief": "Discuss how to distinguish timing issues, missing stakeholders, weak business cases, and unresolved objections from opportunities that are unlikely to progress.",
