    "rawCopy": "Automating sales outreach without human oversight is a reckless gamble with your enterprise brand.\n\nWe have all seen the disasters: automated AI emails hallucinating pricing discounts, referencing the wrong stakeholder, or adopting an awkwardly robotic tone.\n\nThe secret to scaling follow-up excellence is not removing the human. It is putting the human in the reviewer's chair:\n\nThe Governed Follow-Up Loop:\n1. Autonomous Signal Extraction: Instantly isolates the key commitments, objections, and milestones from the recorded call.\n2. Dynamic Synthesis: Drafts a structured executive summary memo tying agreed pain points to proposed next actions.\n3. Human-in-the-Loop Verification: The rep reviews the draft, adjusts personal nuances, confirms commercial parameters, and clicks approve in under 60 seconds.\n4. Multi-Channel Dispatch: Message is sent to the customer while simultaneously logging the exact telemetry in the CRM.\n\nThis workflow turns a 25-minute manual chore into a 1-minute quality check—without ever sending an unvetted message to an enterprise buyer.\n\nHow does your team protect brand tone while scaling sales speed?\n\n#SalesAutomation #Governance #HumanInTheLoop #RevOps #SalesEnablement",
