    "rawCopy": "Pipeline value means nothing without measuring Pipeline Velocity.\n\nA sales pipeline with $10M in opportunities that takes 12 months to convert at a 15% win rate generates exactly:\n$4,109 in revenue per day.\n\nA precision pipeline with just $4M in opportunities that closes in 3 months at a 35% win rate generates:\n$15,555 in revenue per day.\n\nThe second team generates nearly 4x the daily cash flow with less than half the pipeline!\n\nPipeline Velocity is governed by four variables:\nVelocity = (Opportunities × Win Rate % × Average Deal Size $) ÷ Sales Cycle Duration\n\nTo accelerate velocity, top RevOps teams audit Stage Dwell Times:\n- Discovery Stage: Target dwell: 8 days. If an account lingers past 14 days, the commercial pain is unvalidated.\n- Scoping Stage: Target dwell: 14 days. Delays indicate solutions alignment friction.\n- Proposal Stage: Target dwell: 12 days. Delays indicate lack of CFO economic sponsorship.\n- Legal & Security: Target dwell: 10 days. Delays indicate unprepared compliance documentation.\n\nWhen you manage dwell times by stage, sales cycle duration compresses and cash velocity surges.\n\nWhat is your team's current daily pipeline velocity?\n\n#PipelineVelocity #RevOps #SalesOperations #SalesMath #CRO",
