    "rawCopy": "Recording your sales calls is not an AI strategy.\n\nAlmost every B2B company today records Zoom meetings. But what happens to those recordings?\n- They sit in an online folder that nobody has time to re-watch.\n- The rep still spends 20 minutes typing fragmented notes into the CRM.\n- Important buyer objections and agreed deadlines remain buried in an hour of unstructured video.\n\nPassive recording creates a digital landfill.\n\nTrue Meeting Intelligence transforms unstructured conversational audio into structured commercial execution:\n\n1. Entity & Milestone Extraction: Automatically isolates the buyer's stated P&L metrics, mentioned competitors, and agreed internal milestones.\n2. Zero-Click CRM Synchronization: Updates opportunity stage, closes out tasks, and logs next action dates without the rep touching a keyboard.\n3. Pre-Drafted Board-Ready Memos: Generates a tailored executive follow-up memo in the rep's inbox within 3 minutes of call completion.\n4. Coachable Behavioral Telemetry: Automatically scores talk-to-listen ratios, objection handling efficacy, and executive multi-threading.\n\nStop storing video files. Start extracting actionable revenue telemetry.\n\nHow much time do your sales managers spend listening to recorded calls each week?\n\n#MeetingIntelligence #SalesTechnology #ConversationAI #RevOps #SalesEnablement",
