    "targetAudience": "Chief Financial Officers, VPs of Finance & FP&A Leaders",
    "contentBrief": "Show how to define a baseline, identify attributable outcomes, record costs, choose a measurement period, and state uncertainty.",
    "mdPath": "single-image/executive-perspectives/094-establishing-credible-roi-baselines.md",
